# @last-edited: 2026-10-06 10:27 UTC+7.
# @title: _headers — the CSP and cache policy every path of the site answers with.
# @state: restates vercel.json per path; tests/landing-hosting.test.mjs fails on drift.
# @dependencies: none.

# WHY this file exists: the site is served by Cloudflare Pages as well as Vercel, and
# Pages configures headers with this file instead of vercel.json. One path per block:
# a comma-joined path line matches nothing on Cloudflare, so every rule silently
# went unapplied and the edge served its defaults instead of this policy. Measured
# live: no CSP and the wrong referrer policy on every page until this shape.
# tests/landing-hosting.test.mjs fails on any drift.

/
# from vercel.json /(.*)
  Cache-Control: no-store
  Vercel-CDN-Cache-Control: no-store
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; connect-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

